{"uid":"2d01ad864ac4eaef","name":"QA 2111","fullName":"QA #2111 on ubuntu2604-container","historyId":"2111@ubuntu2604-container","time":{"start":1792799352000,"stop":1792799359000,"duration":7000},"description":"PCP QA Test No. 2111\n\nExercise pmlogpush HTTP Basic authentication over a secure (TLS) connection.\n\n\n\nThe push model authenticates its clients against pmcd, reusing PCP's SASL\n\nmachinery: pmproxy holds no password store of its own, it validates the\n\nsupplied credentials by opening a short-lived authenticated pmcd context.\n\nThis test provisions a real pmcd SASL user (as qa/1388 does) and verifies:\n\n- pmlogpush --secure -U/-P with valid credentials succeeds against a\n\npmproxy that requires authentication ([pmlogger] authenticate = true)\n\n- the password may be read from --password-file or $PCP_PUSH_PASSWORD\n\n- a valid user with the wrong password is rejected and no archive is written\n\n- --secure with no credentials is rejected and no archive is written\n\n- -U without --secure is refused client-side: credentials are never sent\n\nover a cleartext or unauthenticated connection\n\n\n\ncheck-group-include: pmlogpush\n\n\n\nCopyright (c) 2025 Red Hat.  All Rights Reserved.\n\n\n\n","descriptionHtml":"<p>PCP QA Test No. 2111</p>\n<p>Exercise pmlogpush HTTP Basic authentication over a secure (TLS) connection.</p>\n<p>The push model authenticates its clients against pmcd, reusing PCP's SASL</p>\n<p>machinery: pmproxy holds no password store of its own, it validates the</p>\n<p>supplied credentials by opening a short-lived authenticated pmcd context.</p>\n<p>This test provisions a real pmcd SASL user (as qa/1388 does) and verifies:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>pmlogpush --secure -U/-P with valid credentials succeeds against a</li>\n</ul>\n<p>pmproxy that requires authentication ([pmlogger] authenticate = true)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>the password may be read from --password-file or $PCP_PUSH_PASSWORD</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>a valid user with the wrong password is rejected and no archive is written</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>--secure with no credentials is rejected and no archive is written</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>-U without --secure is refused client-side: credentials are never sent</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>over a cleartext or unauthenticated connection</p>\n<p>check-group-include: pmlogpush</p>\n<p>Copyright (c) 2025 Red Hat.  All Rights Reserved.</p>\n","status":"passed","statusMessage":"","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[],"afterStages":[],"labels":[{"name":"suite","value":"ubuntu2604-container"},{"name":"host","value":"ubuntu2604-container"},{"name":"epic","value":"pmproxy"},{"name":"epic","value":"pmlogpush"},{"name":"epic","value":"libpcp_web"},{"name":"epic","value":"secure"},{"name":"epic","value":"pmcd"},{"name":"epic","value":"local"},{"name":"resultFormat","value":"allure2"}],"parameters":[],"links":[{"name":"Source","url":"https://github.com/performancecopilot/pcp/tree/791edf838b2ea39b18952cc0212b0d236489570a/qa/2111","type":"test_case"},{"name":"Expected output","url":"https://github.com/performancecopilot/pcp/tree/791edf838b2ea39b18952cc0212b0d236489570a/qa/2111.out","type":"test_case"}],"hidden":false,"retry":false,"extra":{"severity":"normal","retries":[],"categories":[],"history":{"statistic":{"failed":0,"broken":0,"skipped":0,"passed":22,"unknown":0,"total":22},"items":[{"uid":"d46ac39b6536d03","reportUrl":"https://performancecopilot.github.io/qa-reports/reports/20261023_002528-c42b90f5//#testresult/d46ac39b6536d03","status":"passed","statusDetails":"","time":{"start":1792714007000,"stop":1792714014000,"duration":7000}},{"uid":"8f6d7969785b3ec","reportUrl":"https://performancecopilot.github.io/qa-reports/reports/20261022_003053-c42b90f5//#testresult/8f6d7969785b3ec","status":"passed","statusDetails":"","time":{"start":1792626278000,"stop":1792626286000,"duration":8000}},{"uid":"18b03d8a5972647e","reportUrl":"https://performancec